# ===== Per-machine launcher / helper scripts =====
# LAN-test launchers and play helpers carry window titles and local paths, so they are per-machine
# convenience, not collaborative source. The `!Game/coop-*.bat` allow-list below overrides this.
*.bat

# ===== Per-machine editor and agent config =====
# Machine-local paths, plus one developer's working rituals; not part of the mod.
.claude/*

# CLAUDE.md is a per-user development notebook, read as project context by the
# agent, and is local-only. Its tracked copy was untracked via `git rm --cached` in the
# same commit that adds this line.
CLAUDE.md
# Claude's persistent memory lives at the per-user path
# (C:\Users\<user>\.claude\projects\<slug>\memory), NOT in the repo. A single
# a stray memory file can be written into a project-local memory/ dir and
# committed by mistake; ignoring the path makes that impossible.
/memory/

